 "name_en": "Basic Bank Account Management (BFA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Basic Bank Account Management (BFA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With Basic Bank Account Management, cash managers and bank accountants can centralize the management of bank accounts using bank account master data, using a table view of banks and bank accounts.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Bank account master processing includes:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Creating a bank account</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Changing a bank account</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Closing an obsolete bank account</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Reopening a closed bank account</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Manage bank and bank account master data with direct revision activation (Create/change/close/reopen bank account)</p><p class=\"p\"></p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage bank and bank account master data centrally</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Upload and download bank accounts freely</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>基本银行账户管理 (BFA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过基本银行账户管理，现金经理和银行会计可以使用银行账户主数据，使用银行和银行账户的表视图来集中管理银行账户。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">银行账户主数据处理包括：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 创建银行账户</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 更改银行账户</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 关闭作废的银行账户</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 重新打开已关闭的银行账户</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">通过直接修订激活管理银行和银行账户主数据（创建/更改/关闭/重新打开银行账户）</p><p class=\"p\"></p></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3e76440e06794ab585680d42900e6ecd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集中管理银行和银行账户主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自由上载和下载银行账户</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
